  "decisions": [
   "AuthError's three variants render the IDENTICAL 401 body (not just the same status) — the plan's own must-have that a missing cookie and an unknown token be indistinguishable, generalized to the disabled/expired-session case too, matching the crate's established reject-identically discipline",
   "Argon2/password-hash types are imported exclusively through argon2's own re-export (argon2::password_hash::...), never the standalone password-hash 0.6.1 crate this plan also adds — the dependency graph resolves two DIFFERENT versions of password-hash (0.5.0 via argon2, 0.6.1 direct), and mixing them fails to typecheck",
   "rand_core@0.6 added as a direct dependency (feature unification fix) so argon2's SaltString::generate(&mut OsRng) compiles — OsRng needs rand_core's getrandom feature, which nothing in the dependency graph turned on by default",
   "cookie@0.18.1 promoted from transitive (via axum-extra) to a direct dependency so build_session_cookie can reference cookie::time::Duration for Max-Age — same already-resolved version, no new untrusted package",
   "Disabled account's login attempt still runs the real Argon2id verify against its real hash before failing on the disabled check, preserving D-18's timing-consistency property for that path too (not required by the plan's must-haves, but consistent with the same discipline)"
  ],
